-- Creatures & Legends, Random Acts of Weird Facts, Superlative Showdown,
-- Time Machine, and Pop Culture Time Capsule — 240 total — plus Would You
-- Rather brought up by 60 (30 "round 3" + 30 "round 4"), since round 3's
-- WYR batch was drafted but never actually seeded until now. Mirrors the
-- app's bundled SeedQuestions.swift; this file is generated from the same
-- parsed source as those additions, so the two stay in sync.
--
-- Would You Rather is the only prediction genre here (no authored answer);
-- correct_option_id stays null, same as every prior WYR batch.

